WEBVTT

00:00:04.249 --> 00:00:09.322
<v><b>Announcement:</b></v> This is the final call for flight BA641 to London Heathrow.

00:00:09.557 --> 00:00:13.614
Would all passengers please proceed to gate B5?

00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:17.528
<v><b>Attendant 1:</b></v> Can I see your passport and boarding pass, please?

00:00:18.034 --> 00:00:18.901
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:24.749 --> 00:00:26.016
<v><b>Attendant 2:</b></v> Good afternoon, madam.

00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:27.776
Your boarding pass, please?

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:30.000
Seat 30D.

00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:32.452
This way, please.

00:00:34.332 --> 00:00:38.149
<v><b>Eve:</b></v> Oh, what a nice surprise! We meet again!

00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:40.849
<v><b>Wendy:</b></v> Oh, hello!